4182144227458465_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0JoAiY7EYPQQ7kNvwFzwipD&_nc_oc=AdqqeMmcmOAvZjZjfjJjogLaGqToM1bqmmrOhxkMZ5Zl6F9yam5pQAPrVp6vlz-isfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQESfaFXHG42T7AARCRrC4xD9vclf-DYWHSaiMuCfqXGgQ&oe=6A773361"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bowling VR Club: Strike Arena", "keywords": ["bowlingvr", "vrbowlinggame", "bowlingsimulator", "3dbowlinggame", "bowlinggamevr"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfb3\ud83c\udfc6 Bowling VR Club: Strike Arena is an immersive virtual reality bowling simulator that delivers realistic 3D physics, competitive gameplay, and thrilling strike-based challenges. Step into a dynamic VR bowling world where precision, timing, and skill decide every roll.\n\nExperience ultra-realistic bowling mechanics with advanced physics that make every throw feel natural and powerful. Compete in exciting strike arenas inside a virtual bowling club environment designed for both casual fun and competitive play.\n\nEach lane offers unique challenges where you can improve your aim, control spin, and perfect your strike technique. Whether you\u2019re aiming for a spare or a perfect 300 game, every match tests your consistency and focus.\n\n\u2728 Features:\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfb3 Realistic VR bowling simulator gameplay\n\u2022 \ud83e\udde0 Advanced 3D physics engine for accurate ball movement\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f Competitive strike arenas in immersive environments\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Smooth VR motion controls for natural throwing experience\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfaf Precision aiming and spin control mechanics\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfc6 Tournament-style bowling club competitions\n\u2022 \ud83d\udd01 High replay value with skill-based progression\n\nPlay in beautifully designed bowling alleys brought to life in VR, offering a true-to-life sports experience. Challenge yourself, improve your skills, and climb the ranks in the ultimate bowling VR competition.\n\nBecome the champion of the lanes in Bowling VR Club: Strike Arena and master the art of precision bowling in virtual reality.", "short_description": "\ud83c\udfb3 Bowling VR Club: Strike Arena is an immersive VR bowling simulator with realistic 3D physics, smooth motion controls, and competitive strike-based gameplay. Experience authentic bowling action inside dynamic 3D bowling arenas where every roll depends on precision, timing, and skill. Compete in exciting club tournaments, master spin control, and aim for perfect strikes. Enjoy realistic bowling alley environments and challenging lanes designed for both casual and competitive VR players."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fun-soft/privacy-policy-meta-quest", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fun Soft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fun-soft/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27096154430054879"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_1011832984898323_8025277597529370999_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VO30oozcQxAQ7kNvwFYamc0&_nc_oc=AdrArkPdqFhHC91yQGFkkOsRtdIA2vbMac9jCbVfWTLKwDwa0IkZz3ui1hidIpygq1U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=sconte